# flair project file
Version: 300
Mode: fluka
Title: Simul for Ilias
md5: 12e350557709a2d0eb42338e6c0f10ca
Input:
TITLE
	Simul for Ilias
GLOBAL ,,,, 1.0 1.0
DEFAULTS NEW-DEFA
*2 GeV/c
BEAM PROTON 2.0,,, 0 0
BEAMPOS , 0.0 0.0 -55.
* ..+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7..
!PHYSICS EVAPORAT 3.
* ..+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7..
!PHYSICS COALESCE 1.
* ..+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7..
!PHYSICS EM-DISSO 2.
* ..+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7..
!PHYSICS IONBRPAI 1.
!IONTRANS , HEAVYION
EMF EMF-OFF
!EMFCUT , 1E-2 1E-2,,, @LASTREG
!EMFCUT PROD-CUT 1E-5 1E-5,, BERYLLIU BERYLLIU 1.
!BIASING PRINT 1.,, 1.0 T2HEAD
!BIASING PRINT 0.0,, 5.0 T2INSHLD
!BIASING PRINT 1.,, 10.0 T2COLL
!BIASING PRINT 1.,, 10.0 AIRBEFB3
!BIASING PRINT 1.,, 100.0 B3TVac
!BIASING PRINT 1.,, 100.0 AIRBEFB2
!BIASING PRINT 1.,, 100.0 B2B3Spec
!BIASING PRINT 1.,, 100.0 AIRBEFD
!BIASING PRINT 1.,, 100.0 DEGR
!BIASING PRINT 1.,, 100.0 AIRAFTER
!BIASING PRINT 1.,, 100.0 NA61exp
* ..+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7..
GEOBEGIN COMBNAME
* Black body
!SPH world 0.0 0.0 0.0 1200.0
* Void sphere
!SPH around 0.0 0.0 0.0 1000.0
RPP world -300. 300. -300. 300. -500. 3500.
RPP around -80 80. -150. 150 -300. 2300
* T2 target head :160mm wide, 2mm height, [40, 100,180,300,500] mm long
!RPP T2 -8. 8. -0.1 0.1 -15. 15.
RPP tcoll -15. 15. -7.5 7.5 64.9 105.1
RCC T2 0.0 0.0 -50,,, 70. 1.0
	@select=1
RPP t2insh -42. 42. -40. 40. -65. 65.
RPP t2outsh -60. 60. -120. 120. -105. 105.
* Dummy air - over estimated by 0.5 m
RPP AIRFIRST -60. 60. -120. 120. 105.1 165.0
* Magnets Kit : y=690 mm, x=1200 mm
RPP MTNHo1 -60.0 60.0 -34.5 34.5 165. 525.
RPP MTNHv1 -20.0 20. -3. 3. 165. 525.
RPP MTNHo2 -60. 60. -34.5 34.5 585. 945.
RPP MTNHv2 -20. 20. -3. 3. 585. 945.
* Air Before B2B3 region
RPP airbefb2 -20. 20. -3. 3. 945.1 950.0
* First beam spectrometer
RPP B2B3 -20. 20. -34.5 34.5 950.1 951.0
* Air Before Degrader
RPP airbefd -20. 20. -34.5 34.5 951.0 951.1
* Degrader : Polyethylene, Thickness 40 mm
RPP Degr -20. 20. -34.5 34.5 951.1 955.1
* Air After Degrader
RPP airafter -20. 20. -34.5 34.5 955.1 955.2
* Second beam spectrometer & Experiment
RPP NA61 -20. 20. -34.5 34.5 955.2 957.
RPP VXSS -20.0 20.0 -3. 3. 958. 2200
* BEFTAX
RPP BEFTAX -20. 20. -34.5 34.5 2198 2199
END
* Black hole
REGION BLKBODY 5
	+world -around
* Void around
REGION VOID 5
	+around -airafter -airbefd -airbefb2  -t2outsh -AIRFIRST -tcoll -MTNHo1 -MTNHo2  -B2B3 -Degr -NA61
	-VXSS-BEFTAX
REGION T2SHILD 5
	+t2outsh -t2insh -tcoll
REGION T2INSHLD 5
	+t2insh-tcoll -T2
REGION T2HEAD 5
	+T2
REGION T2COLL 5
	+tcoll
REGION B3TFe 5
	+MTNHo1-MTNHv1 | +MTNHo2 -MTNHv2
REGION B3TVac 5
	+MTNHv1 | +MTNHv2
REGION B2B3Spec 5
	+B2B3
REGION DEGR 5
	+Degr
REGION NA61exp 5
	+NA61
REGION VXSS 5
	VXSS-BEFTAX
REGION BEFTAX 5
	+BEFTAX
REGION AIRBEFB2 5
	+airbefb2
REGION AIRBEFD 5
	+airbefd
REGION AIRAFTER 5
	+airafter
REGION AIRBEFB3 5
	+AIRFIRST
END
GEOEND
LOW-MAT CARBON GRAPHITE 6. -3. 296.
* ..+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7..
MATERIAL AIR,,, 0.001225
* ..+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7..
MATERIAL AIR2,,, 0.001225
MAT-PROP USERDIRE 1.,,, AIR2
COMPOUND AIR -0.78 NITROGEN -0.21 OXYGEN -0.01 ARGON
COMPOUND AIR2 -0.78 NITROGEN -0.21 OXYGEN -0.01 ARGON
MATERIAL GRAPHITE 6.,, 1.78
MAT-PROP ,,, 78.0 GRAPHITE
STERNHEI GRAPHITE 3.155 0.048 2.5387 0.20762 2.9532 0.14
* ..+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7..
ASSIGNMA , BLCKHOLE BLKBODY
ASSIGNMA , BLCKHOLE VOID
ASSIGNMA , TITANIUM T2HEAD
ASSIGNMA , BLCKHOLE T2SHILD
ASSIGNMA , AIR2 T2INSHLD
ASSIGNMA , BLCKHOLE T2COLL
ASSIGNMA , BLCKHOLE B3TFe
ASSIGNMA , BLCKHOLE B3TVac
ASSIGNMA , VACUUM B2B3Spec
ASSIGNMA , VACUUM DEGR
ASSIGNMA , AIR2 NA61exp
ASSIGNMA , AIR2 AIRBEFB2
ASSIGNMA , VACUUM AIRBEFD
ASSIGNMA , AIR AIRAFTER
ASSIGNMA , BLCKHOLE AIRBEFB3
ASSIGNMA , BLCKHOLE VXSS
ASSIGNMA , AIR2 BEFTAX
USRBIN Beampart 10. BEAMPART -90. 100. 50. 100.0 -100. -50. -200. 200. 200. 100.
USRBIN Pions 10. PIONS+- -91 100. 50. 100.0 -100. -50. -200. 200. 200. 100.
!AUXSCORE , USRYIELD -20808200,, NA61Be NA61Be
OPEN UNKNOWN 95.
	t2_air.dat
!OPEN UNKNOWN 96.
	befdeg.dat
!OPEN UNKNOWN 97.
	na61exp_air.dat
!OPEN UNKNOWN 98
	BEFTAX_air.dat
RANDOMIZ
START , 1000000.,,,, 0.0
STOP
EndInput

Submit: Local
Page: Run
Compile: ESS.exe
	source: ['usrmed_fprod.f']
End

